{"path":"utility/basic_stacktrace/empty","title":"std::basic_stacktrace<Allocator>::empty","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_stacktrace&lt;Allocator&gt;::</span>empty","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/basic_stacktrace/empty","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Checks if the stacktrace has no stacktrace entries.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> empty<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Checks if the stacktrace has no stacktrace entries.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if the stacktrace is empty, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stacktrace&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/boolalpha\"><span class=\"kw1781\">std::<span class=\"me2\">boolalpha</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/basic_stacktrace\"><span class=\"kw3635\">std::<span class=\"me2\">stacktrace</span></span></a> bktr<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Initially, bktr.empty(): \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> bktr.<span class=\"me1\">empty</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    bktr <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">stacktrace</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">current</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"After getting entries, bktr.empty(): \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> bktr.<span class=\"me1\">empty</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Initially, bktr.empty(): true\nAfter getting entries, bktr.empty(): false</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/basic_stacktrace/size\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>size</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the number of stacktrace entries <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/basic_stacktrace","title":"std::basic_stacktrace"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_stacktrace<Allocator>::empty","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Checks if the stacktrace has no stacktrace entries."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"true if the stacktrace is empty, false otherwise."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"size","note":"returns the number of stacktrace entries"}]}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":87,"codeBlockCount":2}
